          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mmanyire h'oikara, oku nuho hali ekitebe eky'obukama bwa Sitaani; baitu iwe okyagumiire ha ibara lyange kandi oteehooge nkooku orukunyikiriza, noobu haakubaire omu biro by'Antipa, kaiso wange omwesigwa, ayaitiirwe owaanyu oku nambere Sitaani aikara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
